    "${ORANGE}██╔═══╝ ██║██║╚██╗██║██║     ██╔══██║██╔══██╗██║   ██║╚════██║${NC}" \
    "${ORANGE}██║     ██║██║ ╚████║╚██████╗██║  ██║██████╔╝╚██████╔╝███████║${NC}" \
    "${DARKBLUE}╚═╝     ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═══╝ ╚═════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═════╝  ╚═════╝ ╚══════╝${NC}"

  pco_hr

